    <bpmn:task id="Bridge_4_3116" name="Here are two options for the transition sentence:&#10;&#10;**Option 1 (Focus on the Solution Enabling Connectivity):**&#10;&#62; Once the IT solution is successfully deployed to the department, if it enables or requires external business-to-business connectivity, this triggers the initiation of the Citigroup B2B U-Turn request process.&#10;&#10;**Option 2 (Focus on the Department&#39;s Need):**&#10;&#62; Following the implementation of the requested IT solution, if the department now needs to establish a secure inter-corporation connection, they must initiate the Citigroup B2B U-Turn request process." />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_4" sourceRef="atom_3_ExclusiveGateway_5" targetRef="Bridge_4_3116" />
